    "signature_algorithm": "braintree_hmac_sha1_over_sha1_of_private_key",
    "signature_encoding": "hex",
    "_comment": "Braintree signs the raw `bt_payload` form value with HMAC-SHA1 keyed by the SHA-1 DIGEST of the merchant private key, and returns `pubkey1|sig1&pubkey2|sig2&...` in the `bt_signature` form field - not in a header. There is therefore no `signature_header` and no generator arm in webhook_signatures.rs: each body below carries a precomputed signature over the dummy keypair declared in its own `webhook_secrets` (secret = private key, additional_secret = public key)."
  },
